---
// Real stynx-code session screenshot — senior delegating to a `mimo` intern.
---

<section class="section showcase" id="showcase">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">// see it in action</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Real sessions. Real delegation.</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">
        A live <code>stynx</code> session: the senior reads the README, then
        hands the analysis to a <code>mimo</code> intern via
        <code>delegate_to_mimo</code> — model, elapsed time, and running cost
        right there in the status bar.
      </p>
    </div>

    <figure class="shot reveal">
      <img
        src="/stynx-tui.png"
        width="1999"
        height="1251"
        alt="stynx-code terminal UI: the Tools sidebar shows a Read of README.md and a delegate_to_mimo call; the conversation shows the senior delegating README analysis to a mimo intern; the status bar shows the develop branch, deepseek-v4-pro model, a 1m 30s generating timer and a $0.0129 cost."
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </figure>

    <ul class="callouts">
      <li>
        <span class="dot" style="--c: var(--iris)"></span>
        <div class="co-body">
          <strong>Tools sidebar</strong>
          <p>Every <code>read</code>, <code>grep</code>, and <code>delegate_to_*</code> call, live.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="dot" style="--c: var(--foam)"></span>
        <div class="co-body">
          <strong>Intern delegation</strong>
          <p>The senior routes work to the <code>mimo</code> intern with one tool call.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="dot" style="--c: var(--gold)"></span>
        <div class="co-body">
          <strong>Live status bar</strong>
          <p>Branch, model, generating timer, and cost-per-turn at a glance.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .shot {
    margin: 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--hl-med);
    box-shadow: 0 40px 90px -30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 120% at 50% 0%, rgba(196, 167, 231, 0.14), transparent 55%),
      var(--surface);
    line-height: 0;
  }
  .shot img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .callouts {
    list-style: none;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  .callouts li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.7rem;
  }
  .co-body strong {
    display: block;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .co-body p {
    color: var(--subtle);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .callouts code {
    color: var(--foam);
    font-size: 0.85em;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .dot {
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--c);
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 760px) {
    .callouts {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
